<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan forex kerb market closed by strike.</title>
<headline>Pakistan forex kerb market closed by strike.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foreign exchange kerb market in the Pakistani port city of Karachi remained shut on Saturday owing to a general strike called by the ethnic Mohajir National Movement to protest against the induction of a woman deputy of the party in the Sindh provincial cabinet allegedly under pressure.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
